    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quā^drantal</span></b> ,
		ālis, n.
		quadrantalis. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A liquid measure containing eight</i> congii, <i>a quadrantal</i>, Cato ap. <i><span class="en">Fest.
				p. 258, 20</span></i> Müll.; <i><span class="en">id. R.
				R. 57, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc. 1, 2, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14,
				14, 16, § 95</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A die</i>, <i>cube</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 1,
				20, 3</span></i>.</div>
